dashboard.definition:
{
	"title": "NetOps Readiness",
	"inputs": {
		"input_global_trp": {
			"options": {
				"defaultValue": "-7d@h,now",
				"token": "global_time"
			},
			"title": "Time range",
			"type": "input.timerange"
		},
		"input_site_filter": {
			"options": {
				"defaultValue": "",
				"token": "site_filter"
			},
			"title": "Focus site (optional, click a bar to set; clear for all sites)",
			"type": "input.text"
		}
	},
	"defaults": {
		"dataSources": {
			"ds.search": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			},
			"ds.spl2": {
				"options": {
					"queryParameters": {
						"earliest": "$global_time.earliest$",
						"latest": "$global_time.latest$"
					}
				}
			}
		},
		"tokens": {
			"default": {
				"site_filter": {
					"value": "*"
				}
			}
		}
	},
	"visualizations": {
		"viz_a_nrs_forecast": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotations",
				"primary": "ds_a_nrs_forecast"
			},
			"description": "Network Readiness Score for the past N days plus a 24-hour forecast with 95% confidence band. Forecast uses the predict command and adapts to seasonality and recent trend. The grey band is where NRS is statistically expected to land.",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": "> annotation | seriesByName('annotation_color')",
				"annotationLabel": "> annotation | seriesByName('label')",
				"annotationX": "> annotation | seriesByName('_time')",
				"legendDisplay": "top",
				"lineCurveStyle": "smooth",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#D64550",
					"#CCCCCC",
					"#CCCCCC"
				],
				"xAxisTitleText": "Time",
				"yAxisMax": 100,
				"yAxisMin": 0,
				"yAxisTitleText": "NRS",
				"markerDisplay": "outlined"
			},
			"title": "NRS forecast - next 24 hours (95% confidence band)",
			"type": "splunk.line"
		},
		"viz_about": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
				"fontColor": "#333333",
				"markdown": "## About this dashboard and shipped NOC alerts\n\n### NRS Formula\n\n**NRS = (0.30 × A + 0.30 × R + 0.25 × Q) × D_risk**\n\n- **A - Attainability (DNAC)**: percentage of access points with `Reachability=REACHABLE`.\n- **R - Retainability (DNAC)**: 50% APs with `OverallHealth >= 7` and 50% clients with `health.overallScore >= 5`.\n- **Q - Quality (DNAC)**: in the headline NRS, 60% mean client health (×10 to scale to 100) and 40% onboarding-time score (100 if avg ≤ 1s, 0 if ≥ 5s, linear in between). The standalone Q tile additionally blends 30% RSSI signal strength.\n- **D_risk - Risk deflator**: 1.0 − 0.05·P1 − 0.02·P2 (count of distinct active P1/P2 IssueIDs from `cisco:dnac:issue`). Floored at 0.5 so a catastrophe still leaves something to recover.\n\n### Why max NRS ≈ 85, not 100\n\nThe top-level weights sum to 0.85, not 1.0. The remaining 15% is reserved for future sub-scores (e.g., per-floor saturation, ThousandEyes path quality). For now, treat ≥ 80 as healthy, 70-79 as watch, < 70 as act-now. Tile thresholds are tunable in the score visualization once the weights are re-tuned via the `nrs_w_nrs_*` macros.\n\n### Data sources\n\n- **DNAC / Catalyst Center** (`cisco:dnac:devicehealth`, `cisco:dnac:client`, `cisco:dnac:issue`): the network-side truth - which APs are up, how clients are doing, what's broken.\n- **Cisco Spaces Firehose** (`cisco:spaces:firehose`, eventType `DEVICE_PRESENCE` and `DEVICE_ASSOCIATION`): the demand-side truth - how many people are actually on the network, where, on which SSID.\n\n### Shipped alerts (savedsearches.conf)\n\n- **NRS Below Threshold** - fires when headline NRS drops below 75.\n- **AP Saturation** - fires when any AP exceeds 30 concurrent clients.\n- **AP Health Degraded** - fires when any AP's `OverallHealth` drops below 7.\n- **Client Health Degraded** - fires when avg client health drops below 5."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_arq_legend": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
				"fontColor": "#333333",
				"markdown": "**NRS = (0.30·A + 0.30·R + 0.25·Q) × D_risk**\n\n- **A** - % of APs with `Reachability=REACHABLE`\n- **R** - 50% APs with health ≥ 7 and 50% clients with health ≥ 5\n- **Q** - 60% mean client health (×10) + 40% onboarding-time score (headline). Standalone Q tile adds 30% RSSI.\n- **D_risk** - 1.0 − 0.05·P1 − 0.02·P2 from `cisco:dnac:issue`, floor 0.5\n\n*Score scale:* max achievable ≈ 85 (see About). ≥ 80 green, 70-79 amber, < 70 red."
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_b_capacity_gauge": {
			"context": {
				"rangeColorsEditorConfig": [
					{
						"to": 60,
						"value": "#6EBE4A"
					},
					{
						"from": 60,
						"to": 80,
						"value": "#E5A823"
					},
					{
						"from": 80,
						"value": "#D64550"
					}
				]
			},
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_b_capacity_gauge"
			},
			"description": "Network-wide utilization: peak concurrent users (sum across all sites, from Spaces) divided by total AP capacity (DNAC AP count × 30 design-maximum clients per AP). Read alongside Q1 and Q2 below for site-level detail.",
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "> majorValue | rangeValue(rangeColorsEditorConfig)",
				"majorValue": "> primary | seriesByName(\"used_pct\") | lastPoint()",
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true,
				"unit": "%",
				"unitPosition": "after"
			},
			"title": "Network Capacity Utilization",
			"type": "splunk.singlevalueradial"
		},
		"viz_box_a_forecast": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_a_headline": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_a_persite": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_a_trend": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_b_aphealth": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_b_capacity": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_b_gauge": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "#ffffff",
				"rounding": 8,
				"strokeColor": "#dde1e6"
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_b_people": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_c_corr": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_c_forecast": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_c_q4": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_c_q5": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_c_q6": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_c_q7": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_d_clients": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_d_recovery": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_d_surge": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_d_wow": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_box_e_about": {
			"options": {
				"fillColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0.78)",
				"rx": 10,
				"strokeColor": "rgba(0,0,0,0.08)",
				"strokeWidth": 1
			},
			"type": "splunk.rectangle"
		},
		"viz_c_issues_forecast": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotations",
				"primary": "ds_c_issues_forecast"
			},
			"description": "DNAC active issues per hour with a 24-hour forecast. Use the upper-95 band to size your night shift or pre-position support resources before a predicted spike.",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": "> annotation | seriesByName('annotation_color')",
				"annotationLabel": "> annotation | seriesByName('label')",
				"annotationX": "> annotation | seriesByName('_time')",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"lineCurveStyle": "smooth",
				"markerDisplay": "outlined",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#D64550",
					"#049FD9",
					"#CCCCCC",
					"#CCCCCC"
				],
				"xAxisTitleText": "Time",
				"yAxisTitleText": "Active issues (dc IssueID)"
			},
			"title": "Active issues forecast - next 24 hours (95% confidence band)",
			"type": "splunk.line"
		},
		"viz_correlation_strip": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotations",
				"primary": "ds_correlation_strip"
			},
			"description": "One Splunk timechart, three sourcetypes (cisco:dnac:devicehealth, cisco:dnac:issue, cisco:spaces:firehose). Watch how DNAC Active Issues spike when Spaces Concurrent Users surge - and how AP Health dips at the same time. Annotations overlay the ExPlan operational milestones (STARTEX, NHC Advisories, County Coordination Calls, PAUSEX, ENDEX). Each series uses carry-forward fill so a sparse ingestion day (e.g. an outage in the upstream Catalyst Center / Spaces collector) doesn't drop the line to zero.",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": "> annotation | seriesByName('annotation_color')",
				"annotationLabel": "> annotation | seriesByName('label')",
				"annotationX": "> annotation | seriesByName('_time')",
				"legendDisplay": "bottom",
				"lineCurveStyle": "smooth",
				"markerDisplay": "outlined",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"overlayFields": [
					"DNAC Active Issues",
					"Spaces Concurrent Users"
				],
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#D64550",
					"#E5A823"
				],
				"showOverlayY2Axis": true,
				"showXMajorGridLines": true,
				"showYMajorGridLines": true,
				"xAxisTitleVisibility": "hide",
				"y2AxisAbbreviation": "auto",
				"y2AxisTitleText": "Issues / Concurrent users",
				"yAxisTitleText": "AP Health (0-100)"
			},
			"title": "Splunk Cross-Source Correlation - Catalyst (AP Health + Issues) and Spaces (Concurrent Users)",
			"type": "splunk.line"
		},
		"viz_d_wow_users": {
			"dataSources": {
				"annotation": "ds_annotations",
				"primary": "ds_d_wow_users"
			},
			"description": "Hourly concurrent users (unique MAC addresses from Cisco Spaces). Two series share the same x-axis (last 7 calendar days). 'This week' = the actual last 7 days. 'Last week' = the prior 7 days, time-shifted +7 days so its Monday lines up with this Monday, its Tuesday with this Tuesday, etc. Any divergence between the two lines is the operational story. Panel always shows exactly 14 days of data regardless of the dashboard time picker.",
			"options": {
				"annotationColor": "> annotation | seriesByName('annotation_color')",
				"annotationLabel": "> annotation | seriesByName('label')",
				"annotationX": "> annotation | seriesByName('_time')",
				"legendDisplay": "top",
				"lineCurveStyle": "smooth",
				"nullValueDisplay": "connect",
				"seriesColors": [
					"#049FD9",
					"#9AA0A6"
				],
				"stackMode": "stacked",
				"xAxisTitleText": "Hour of week (last week shifted +7d for alignment)",
				"yAxisTitleText": "Concurrent users (dc MAC, hourly)"
			},
			"title": "Concurrent users - This week vs Last week",
			"type": "splunk.area"
		},
		"viz_hdr_a_forecast": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## NRS forecast - next 24 hours (predict + 95% band)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_a_headline": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Network Readiness Score"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_a_persite": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Per-Site Readiness"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_a_trend": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## NRS Over Time"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_b_aphealth": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## AP Health Risk Triage"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_b_capacity": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Forecast — Capacity Headroom"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_b_gauge": {
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "transparent",
				"majorColor": "#1a1a1a",
				"majorFontSize": 16,
				"majorValue": "Network capacity utilization at a glance",
				"shouldAbbreviateMajorValue": true,
				"shouldAbbreviateTrendValue": true
			},
			"type": "splunk.singlevalue"
		},
		"viz_hdr_b_people": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Forecast — People per AP"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_c_corr": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Cross-Source Correlation Strip - Catalyst plus Spaces"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_c_forecast": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Active issues forecast - next 24 hours (predict + 95% band)"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_c_q4": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Q4 — Onboarding Success & Concurrent Users"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_c_q5": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Q5 — AP Saturation"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_hdr_c_q6": {
			"options": {
				"fontColor": "#D64550",
				"fontSize": "small",
				"markdown": "## Q6 — Issues & Occupancy"
